pair_login.description:
Open this URL in your own browser and log in with your Tesla account:

{authorize_url}

After logging in, Tesla will try to redirect to a page that doesn't exist (an error or "open in app?" prompt is expected) - copy the *full* URL from your browser's address bar at that point and paste it below.

pair_success.description:
Key verified and registered against {site_name} (DIN {din}).

Public key fingerprint (SHA-256): {fingerprint}

One more step: connecting to the Powerwall itself, over its regular network address - no password needed from here on.

